{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21816","headline":"有酒十章 十 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒兮再祝，祝予心兮何欲。\n欲天泰而地宁，欲人康而岁熟。\n欲凤翥而鵷随兮，欲龙亨而骥逐。\n欲日盛而星微兮，欲滋兰而歼毒。\n欲人欲而天从，苟天未从兮，我可奈何兮一杯又进聊自足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}